Agent World — Remote Coding Agent

Status: Architecture Locked
Surface: https://sentient.powerframe.online/agent-world
System: Sentient OS / Remote Agents

Purpose

Agent World will become the browser-accessible control plane for governed remote coding agents.

The objective is to allow an authenticated operator to inspect repositories, issue development tasks, observe agent execution, review changes, run validation and approve Git operations entirely through the Agent World web interface.

The client machine requires only a supported web browser.

No repository checkout, terminal, coding CLI, GitHub credential, model API key or execution runtime is required on the client machine.

Architectural Decision

DO NOT create a separate agent.powerframe.online coding product.

The existing:

sentient.powerframe.online/agent-world

is the canonical operator surface.

Coding capability must be integrated into Agent World as a governed Remote Agents capability.

